{
  "sn22.94:0.1": "Linked Discourses 22.94 ",
  "sn22.94:0.2": "10. Flowers ",
  "sn22.94:0.3": "Flowers ",
  "sn22.94:1.1": "At Sāvatthī. ",
  "sn22.94:1.2": "“Mendicants, I do not dispute with the world; it is the world that disputes with me. ",
  "sn22.94:1.3": "When your speech is in line with the teaching you do not dispute with anyone in the world. ",
  "sn22.94:1.4": "What the astute deem as not existing, I too say does not exist. ",
  "sn22.94:1.5": "What the astute deem as existing, I too say exists. ",
  "sn22.94:2.1": "And what do the astute deem as not existing, which I too say does not exist? ",
  "sn22.94:2.2": "Form that is permanent, everlasting, eternal, and imperishable. ",
  "sn22.94:2.3": "Feeling … ",
  "sn22.94:2.4": "Perception … ",
  "sn22.94:2.5": "Choices … ",
  "sn22.94:2.6": "Consciousness that is permanent, everlasting, eternal, and imperishable. ",
  "sn22.94:2.7": "This is what the astute deem as not existing, which I too say does not exist. ",
  "sn22.94:3.1": "And what do the astute deem as existing, which I too say exists? ",
  "sn22.94:3.2": "Form that is impermanent, suffering, and perishable. ",
  "sn22.94:3.3": "Feeling … Perception … Choices … ",
  "sn22.94:3.4": "Consciousness that is impermanent, suffering, and perishable. ",
  "sn22.94:3.5": "This is what the astute deem as existing, which I too say exists. ",
  "sn22.94:4.1": "There is a worldly phenomenon in the world that the Realized One understands and comprehends. ",
  "sn22.94:4.2": "Then he expl